      "post_subject": "kitsch holograms",
      "content_md": "How do you get the actual image to show up?\n\nNormaly you could use the normal html IMG tag:\n\nCode: [Select all](#)\n`<img src=\"http://www.triple-take.com/holo_photos/photos/Gallery/kitsch.jpg\">`\n\nBut with your picture this seems to be a problem:\n\nI suppose your provider doesn't allow external links to pictures?\n\nI had this problem with my provider. Put the picture in the PCG Gallery, this should help.",
