      "content_md": "From my thank you note to Dinesh:\n\n\"The holokitsch is truly awful, a fine example of this despised genre.\n\nMr. Bonehead is very scary, and the ghostly double exposure effect is\n\ncool. Seeing the literal realization of snake-eyes as dice protruding\n\nfrom the snake's eye sockets made me cringe - it is so, so, BAD!\n\nI love it.\"",
